sary food or  medicine but that doesn't mean that  taking food or medicine by force thereby  becomes okay it just means that in that  circumstance because of the way the  greatest happiness principle is going to  apply it is allowable in that  circumstance it is it is required he  also taxed funny example here about  kidnapping a doctor right kidnapping and  compelling to officiate the only  qualified medical practitioner this is  the stuff that that you know interesting  movies are made of aren't they but these  exceptional cases really just prove  according to mill the rule of the  greatest happiness principle so as it  turns out justice and utility are  entirely compatible with each other  you
 

